            "review_title": "Review at Han Cook",
            "review_text": "Eugene KUKLIN\n5 contributions\n0\nVery good restaurant\nDec 2019 • Family\nThe idea is: eat all you can. 200 000VND per person. Bullion is included (fish/chicken/beef) and you can add dumplings, pork, beef, vegetables and many other food depending to menu. Drinks is separate.\n\nWe order fish bullion (left at photos) and chicken bullion (right). Added shrimp and vegetable dumplings, pork and beef slices. Which is very tasty!\n\nI recommend to everybody who loves tasty Korean food.\nRead more\nWritten December 8, 2019",
